<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-028" chapter-id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first" source-id="s-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first-ws1511902">
  <p id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p001:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAA">韋放</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p001:m0003" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAA">元直</persName>，車騎將軍<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p001:m0010" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AA">叡</persName>之子。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p002:m0000" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">裴邃</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p002:m0003" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">淵明</persName>，河東聞喜人，魏襄州刺史綽之後也。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p002:m0023" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo">壽孫</persName>，寓居壽陽，爲宋武帝前軍長史。父<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p002:m0041" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_A">仲穆</persName>，驍騎將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p003:m0000" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">之高</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p003:m0003" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">如山</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p003:m0006" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">邃</persName>兄中散大夫<persName id="c-liangshu-028-wei-pei-first:p003:m0012" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AA">髦</persName>之子也。</p>
</text>
